# Sitecore rules

1. Import field types and field components from `@/lib/sitecore` (the SDK swap point).
2. Use field components (`Text`, `RichText`, `Image`, `Link`). Rendering raw `.value` breaks inline editing in Pages.
3. Components must render something meaningful in editing mode when the datasource is empty.
4. Field names in `*.types.ts` must match the Sitecore template field names exactly (case-sensitive).
5. Rendering parameters arrive as strings. Parse numbers and booleans explicitly.
6. Read Sitecore credentials only in server code. Never expose `SITECORE_*` secrets to the client.
7. Do not invent Content SDK APIs. If an API is not in the code base or the official docs, ask.
